    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "ID buffer: remaining/capacity (by biz_tag)",
      "description": "idgen_buffer_remaining/capacity (exported by the idclient SDK in the consumer process): remaining steadily declining toward 0 = refill cannot keep up with consumption (devops-id unreachable or slow); constant 0 = exhausted, the next ID generation falls back to a synchronous RPC and starts failing fast under concurrency. Each replica/gray instance holds its own buffer, distinguished by service_name",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 80
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "idgen_buffer_remaining{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment=~\"$env\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Remaining {{biz_tag}} [{{service_name}}]"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "idgen_buffer_capacity{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment=~\"$env\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Capacity {{biz_tag}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "ID generation: rate & refill failures",
      "description": "idgen_issued_total (local ID-generation rate, business view) and idgen_refill_failures_total. trigger=async is background prefetch failure (early signal); trigger=sync means the buffer is empty and business requests are blocking and retrying — persistent sync failures should be investigated together with the buffer panel against devops-id/etcd",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 88
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (biz_tag) (rate(idgen_issued_total{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment=~\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "IDs issued/s {{biz_tag}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum by (biz_tag, trigger) (rate(idgen_refill_failures_total{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment=~\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "Replenish failures/s {{biz_tag}}[{{trigger}}]"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "ID refill latency P99 (by biz_tag × trigger)",
      "description": "idgen_refill_duration_seconds: BatchNext refill time. Rising async appears before buffer exhaustion (slower prefetch); rising sync directly affects user write requests",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 96
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, biz_tag, trigger) (rate(idgen_refill_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment=~\"$env\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{biz_tag}}[{{trigger}}]"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "ID service: rejection & degradation events",
      "description": "devops-id server-side ID-generation failure event rates (should normally be 0): rejections/s (red, idgen_requests_rejected_total) are the direct upstream of business 500s; local fallbacks/s (orange, idgen_fallback_total) = etcd unavailable, degraded to local slots with a risk of duplicate IDs; lease lost/s (purple, idgen_lease_lost_total) = the slot may be preempted and ID generation is circuit-broken; clock rollbacks/s (yellow, idgen_clock_rollback_total). If any of these leaves 0, immediately correlate with the health-state panel and devops-id logs",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 96
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Rejects/s"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "type": "fixed",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Local fallback/s"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "type": "fixed",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Lease invalidations/s"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "type": "fixed",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "purple"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Clock rollbacks/s"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "type": "fixed",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "yellow"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(idgen_requests_rejected_total{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment=~\"$env\"}[5m])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Rejects/s"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(rate(idgen_fallback_total{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment=~\"$env\"}[5m])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Local fallback/s"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "sum(rate(idgen_lease_lost_total{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment=~\"$env\"}[5m])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Lease invalidations/s"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "expr": "sum(rate(idgen_clock_rollback_total{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment=~\"$env\"}[5m])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Clock rollbacks/s"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "ID service: health state",
      "description": "idgen_health_state (by biz_tag): 0=serving (normal ID generation), 1=degraded (local fallback or consecutive watermark-persistence failures), 2=not_serving (lease lost/closed, ID generation rejected). User write paths start being affected once it jumps to 1/2. The series appears after the first ID request (lazy initialization)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 104
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "idgen_health_state{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment=~\"$env\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{biz_tag}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "ID service: latency quantiles P95 / P99",
      "description": "idgen_batch_latency_seconds (end-to-end time of Next/BatchNext inside devops-id, by method): P95=yellow, P99=red. Compare with “ID refill latency” (caller view) to separate network overhead; compare with the domain-layer baseline (~427ns single-ID hot path, ~2.4M ids/s ceiling after batch amortization) to tell whether ID generation itself slowed down or is dragged by gRPC/batch size",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 104
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "P95.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "type": "fixed",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "yellow"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "P99.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "type": "fixed",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(idgen_batch_latency_seconds_bucket{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment=~\"$env\"}[5m])) by (le, method))",
          "legendFormat": "P95 {{method}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(idgen_batch_latency_seconds_bucket{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment=~\"$env\"}[5m])) by (le, method))",
          "legendFormat": "P99 {{method}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Auth business: login/register rate (by result)",
      "description": "auth_login_total / auth_register_total (service-layer OTel counters, result=success|failure, code is the failure business code). Success/failure curves side by side: failures rising while success is flat = brute force or password-stuffing; both falling = auth chain failure. Fixed colors: success green, failure red; the legend name also states the result, so color is never the only signal",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 112
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "/success/"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "type": "fixed",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "/failure/"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "type": "fixed",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(auth_login_total{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment=~\"$env\"}[5m])) by (result)",
          "legendFormat": "Login {{result}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(rate(auth_register_total{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment=~\"$env\"}[5m])) by (result)",
          "legendFormat": "Register {{result}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Auth business: login failure rate",
      "description": "auth_login_total{result=\"failure\"} / auth_login_total. or vector(0) pads to a displayed 0 when there are no failures; no data at all = no login traffic. >30% yellow, >50% red (50% corresponds to alert DevOpsLoginFailureRateHigh). When it rises steadily, check the code label on the previous panel first: mostly 401 = brute force, mostly 500 = auth chain failure",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 112
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.3
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "(sum(rate(auth_login_total{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment=~\"$env\", result=\"failure\"}[5m])) or vector(0)) / sum(rate(auth_login_total{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment=~\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "Login failure rate"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
